    "k1": { "x": 4620, "y": 0, "w": 420, "text": "Read this canvas left to right, top to bottom — it follows the order of SPEC.md §6.\n\nOrange pins are numbered notes. Each screen lists its notes underneath with the rule ID they enforce (R-6.4.2, DG-15, RR-2 …), so a wireframe and the spec can be checked against each other.\n\nGrey boxes and lines are placeholder content. Hatched fill marks something a rule is deliberately withholding.", "fill": "gray" },
    "k2": { "x": 4620, "y": 4560, "w": 420, "text": "Two boards carry the additions you asked for after v1.0:\n\n• Winners Report (6.9) — month-wise, year-wise, date-wise and combined, with the announcement-date vs award-period toggle drawn explicitly.\n\n• Data Grid Standard (§11) — per-column filter and sort, and the mobile sheets that keep every one of them reachable at 320px.", "fill": "orange" },
    "k3": { "x": 4620, "y": 6080, "w": 420, "text": "Open questions still visible in the drawings:\n\nOQ-1 — votes per cycle, drawn as one.\nOQ-2 — Employee Directory is drawn as admin-managed; an HR sync would make it read-only.\nOQ-3 — Year candidate pool drawn as all active employees.\nOQ-7 — Winners Report drawn as visible to everyone.", "fill": "gray" }
  }
